er">Helliwell, J. R., Ealick, S., Doing, P., Irving, T. &#x00026; Szebenyi, M. (1993). <italic>Acta Cryst.</italic> D<bold>49</bold>, 120&#x02013;128.</citation></ref><ref id="bb35"><citation citation-type="other">Holton, J. M. (2007). <italic>J. Synchrotron Rad.</italic><bold>14</bold>, 51&#x02013;72.</citation></ref><ref id="bb36"><citation citation-type="other">Holton, J. M. (2008). <italic>Expected crystal lifetimes at synchrotron beamlines</italic>, http://bl831.als.lbl.gov/damage_rates.pdf.</citation></ref><ref id="bb37"><citation citation-type="other">Howell, P. L. &#x00026; Smith, G. D. (1992). <italic>J. Appl. Cryst.</italic><bold>25</bold>, 81&#x02013;86.</citation></ref><ref id="bb38"><citation citation-type="other">Howells, M. R., Beetz, T., Chapman, H. N., Chi, C., Holton, J. M., Jacobsen, C. J., Kirz, J., Lima, E., Marchesini, S., Miao, H., Sayre, D., Shapiro, D. A. &#x00026; Spence, J. C. H. (2005). <italic>J. Electron. Spectrosc. Relat. Phenom.</italic> In the press. (Preprint at http://arxiv.org/abs/physics/0502059.)</citation></ref><ref id="bb39"><citation citation-type="other">Hubbell, J. H. (1982). <italic>Int. J. Appl. Radiat. Isotopes</italic>, <bold>33</bold>, 1269&#x02013;1290.</citation></ref><ref id="bb40"><citation citation-type="other">Hubbell, J. H. (2006). <italic>Phys. Med. Biol.</italic><bold>51</bold>, R245&#x02013;R262.</citation></ref><ref id="bb41"><citation citation-type="other">James, R. W. (1962). <italic>The Optical Principles of the Diffraction of X-rays: The Crystalline State</italic>, Vol. II. London: Bell &#x00026; Hyman.</citation></ref><ref id="bb42"><citation citation-type="other">Kahn, R., Fourme, R., Gadet, A., Janin, J., Dumas, C. &#x00026; Andr&#x000e9;, D. (1982). <italic>J. Appl. Cryst.</italic><bold>15</bold>, 330&#x02013;337.</citation></ref><ref id="bb104"><citation citation-type="other">Kauffmann, B., Weiss, M. S., Lamzin, V. S. &#x00026; Schmidt, A. (2006). <italic>Structure</italic>, <bold>14</bold>, 1099&#x